#. module: sale_invoice_partial_with_down_payment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:sale_invoice_partial_with_down_payment.view_sale_advance_payment_inv_partial
msgid ""
"The total down payment already invoiced exceeds the\n"
"                            amount for this partial delivery. Odoo would "
"normally\n"
"                            create a credit note with a negative quantity.\n"
"                            Choose how to handle this below."
msgstr ""
"Le montant total de l'acompte facturé est supérieur au montant à facturer "
"ici.\n"
"Normalement, Odoo fait un avoir avec une quantité négative. \n"
"Choisissez la méthode qui vous convient."

